&_nc_oc=AdpdmgmqK5A0pY61LwTXaGqBRefvJD5tggGI7c5ZjwALd2iJ6yIirUFsY6Ay1_bFd0M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af727MmFw5XtE2pvCZZZJpKkprJhl5tUrf6Z6A3uqirEAQ&oe=6A05E73E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-VPLxjfZ8h4Q7kNvwFUbQCy&_nc_oc=Adr-3Z7lRJhn4iWaKiwKfW5ELgTUNedXfM9tPUMum0TZbFmsVLvajmbgvBEgssDPIg0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af71eObEDnHl22VuPQZre6NHV0AAqUXHyqwn9LTE-9RiwA&oe=6A05BFFC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PBXQcMf5hGQQ7kNvwGRnoBL&_nc_oc=Adq27JZ1fPqLip_3vwHSR3LMV5MM8-QcRQdeq1HdZzvgGPKXEukwssHoB3jzxgFWlzI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af67GwjD6SChCMpejlHOZAQNKQWrWPesRkcEH7GZSAae4g&oe=6A05DE87"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1q6rp2MizlQQ7kNvwEtmHI2&_nc_oc=AdpBM100SSQq1EYFwp7pUZ2egxcGhWhxKztt6Z8dx6HBpaxzBsIGVVNOuVl3hFZeKx4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5scimUEnJbwkTws2sb3BuEOeeaRd5lsf0neBFnWAkO1w&oe=6A05CA55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JTd-9uLrBysQ7kNvwEQkooL&_nc_oc=AdqWU4blVPYhPdPo89qg6Ai5da46bA46kmpvmgHQGPk3_bu-MD_H6Pea75yE3lc_S0Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Le4HVfuSyxqZpIhCGd3S2WTp8WyFbsIEixO6IsIY05g&oe=6A05D6E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.